<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo de Pak control este Shipment&nbsp; ha sido&nbsp; asignado a Uds.para su </span><b>Verificación</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Favor de confirmar </b><font face="arial"><b>Recepción</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;de esta Solicitud y continunar con el seguimiento.</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus actual:&nbsp;</span></font><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status_Plann__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ff0000"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Shipment</b>:</span>{!Shipment__c.Name}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Cliente</b>:</span><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Account_for__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Route</b>:</span>{!Shipment__c.Route__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Proveedor:</b>&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Carrier__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Operador</b>:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.National_Operator__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Vehiculo:</b>&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Vehicle__c}</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Planner:&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Operation_Executive__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Detalles:</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><i style="">Freight Mode: <font color="#333333">{!Customer_Quote__c.Freight_Mode__c}</font></i></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><i style="">Service Mode: <font color="#333333">{!Customer_Quote__c.Service_Mode__c}</font></i></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
